   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "SKETCH -> VOLUME -> 3D (~$0.55 per run)\n\n1. Load a sketch into LoadImage.\n2. Qwen Edit 2511 ($0.03/MP) turns the sketch into a shaded render; edit the prompt for your own object. Alternatives: Gemini Flash 3.1 / Nano Banana Pro.\n3. Bria Remove ($0.018) cuts the object out; a clean background improves the 3D a lot.\n4. Tripo H3.1 (geometry=detailed, ~$0.50) makes the .glb: the file lands in output/, the link is the `info` output. To iterate cheaply use geometry=standard ($0.30) or the Tripo v2.5 node ($0.30 with a standard texture).\n5. Preview3D is an interactive viewer: rotate and zoom with the mouse right in the graph.\n\nOther routes to 3D: Hunyuan3D v3.1 pro (multi-view: sketch from the front plus side/back views) and Hunyuan Sketch->3D ($0.375), which goes straight from a sketch to 3D without steps 2-3 (a fast trial, but the texture is poorer than going through a render).\nIf the sketch is very rough and Qwen struggles, try Nano Banana Pro Edit from the gokayfem pack with the same prompt."
   ],
